# Runtime configuration

The service reads its port and mode from the environment, with safe defaults:

```js
const port = process.env.PORT || 3000;
const mode = process.env.NODE_ENV || 'development';

if (mode !== 'production') {
  console.warn('running outside production mode');
}
```

Document every variable the service reads in `README.md` so operators know what to set.
